title: "Interactive Ricci Flow"
abstract: >-
  A browser workbench for Ricci-flow community detection on networks, with
  Ollivier-Ricci and Forman-Ricci curvature, scoring against ground truth,
  and live human-in-the-loop steering of the flow.
